    {
      "id": "stat.test.t_stat",
      "node_kind": "formula",
      "name": "单样本 t 检验统计量",
      "aliases": [
        "均值假设检验 t 值"
      ],
      "latex": "t = \\frac{\\bar{X} - \\mu_0}{S / \\sqrt{n}} \\sim t(n - 1)",
      "statement": "在原假设 H0: μ = μ0 成立的条件下，衡量样本均值偏离假设均值多少个标准误，是科研与 A/B 测试最常用的检验统计量。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": [
          "mathematics",
          "statistics"
        ],
        "education_stages": [
          "undergraduate"
        ],
        "topics": [
          "statistical_inference"
        ]
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "symbol": "\\mu_0",
